{"seq":1,"slug":"scene-editing-gizmos","title":"场景编辑与 gizmo","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tools-editor-development/editor-features/scene-editing-gizmos","wordCount":1673,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"场景编辑与-gizmo\">场景编辑与 gizmo</h1><p>设计师在三维视口里点中一个箱子，箱子上立刻浮出三根彩色箭头，他拖动红色那根，箱子沿 X 轴滑动。这套交互——选中、操纵手柄（gizmo）、拖拽变换——是所有三维编辑器的心脏，使用频率高到大家觉得它理所当然。但它背后是从二维屏幕坐标反推三维射线、与场景求交、再把鼠标位移正确映射回世界变换的一连串几何运算。做对了无人察觉，做错了手感诡异到没法用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从屏幕点击到三维选中\">核心概念：从屏幕点击到三维选中</h2><p>人在二维屏幕上点了一个像素，要选中三维世界里的物体，本质是个反投影 + 求交问题。相机的投影把三维点压到二维屏幕；点击给的是二维坐标，要还原回三维需要补上缺失的深度维度——办法是从相机出发、穿过该像素，构造一条射线，看它最先撞上场景里的哪个物体。这就是射线拾取（ray picking）。</p>\n<p>构造拾取射线要把屏幕坐标先归一化到设备坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再用相机投影矩阵与视图矩阵的逆变换映射回世界空间，得到射线的起点（相机位置）和方向。然后让这条射线和场景中每个物体的包围体求交，取最近的命中。射线与一个轴对齐包围盒求交可用经典的 slab 方法，对每个轴算出射线进入和离开该轴区间的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\min} = \\max_i \\left( \\frac{b^{\\min}_i - o_i}{d_i} \\right), \\quad t_{\\max} = \\min_i \\left( \\frac{b^{\\max}_i - o_i}{d_i} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span