mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是方向、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是盒子边界。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\min} \\le t_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\max} \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时射线命中盒子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即命中距离，比较所有命中物体的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取最小者即为选中。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拾取方式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包围体射线求交</td>\n<td>CPU 算射线与 AABB/球</td>\n<td>粗（到包围体）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大多数选中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角形级射线求交</td>\n<td>射线逐三角求交</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>精细选面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ID 缓冲拾取</td>\n<td>GPU 渲染物体 ID 到缓冲，读点击像素</td>\n<td>像素级精确</td>\n<td>一次额外绘制</td>\n<td>复杂场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gizmo-的交互机制\">gizmo 的交互机制</h2><p>选中之后，gizmo 负责让用户操纵物体的变换。最常见的是平移 gizmo（三根轴箭头 + 三个平面方块）、旋转 gizmo（三个轴圈）、缩放 gizmo（三根轴 + 末端方块）。gizmo 本身也是用射线拾取来判断用户抓住了哪根轴——拖拽开始时，先拾取确定操纵的是 X、Y 还是 Z 轴（或某个平面），进入对应的拖拽模式。</p>\n<p>拖拽的难点是把鼠标在屏幕上的二维移动，正确翻译成物体在某个轴上的三维位移。以沿 X 轴平移为例：构造一个包含 X 轴、且尽量正对相机的拖拽平面，把拖拽起点和当前鼠标射线分别与这个平面求交，得到两个三维点，它们在 X 轴上的投影差就是位移量。旋转和缩放各有其映射方式（旋转把鼠标移动映射成绕轴角度，缩放映射成比例因子）。下面示意平移拖拽的核心：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"Vec3 ComputeAxisTranslation(Ray dragStart, Ray dragNow, Vec3 axis, Vec3 origin) {&#10;    Plane plane = MakeDragPlane(origin, axis, camera);   // 含轴、面向相机&#10;    Vec3 p0 = RayPlaneIntersect(dragStart, plane);&#10;    Vec3 p1 = RayPlaneIntersect(dragNow, plane);&#10;    float delta = Dot(p1 - p0, axis);                    // 投影到轴上&#10;    return axis * delta;                                  // 仅沿该轴的位移&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vec3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ComputeAxisTranslation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Ray</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dragStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Ray</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dragNow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vec3</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> axis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vec3</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Plane plane </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MakeDragPlane</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(origin, axis, camera);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 含轴、面向相机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vec3 p0 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RayPlaneIntersect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dragStart, plane);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vec3 p1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RayPlaneIntersect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dragNow, plane);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Dot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p0, axis);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // 投影到轴上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> axis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                  // 仅沿该轴的位移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"坐标空间-世界-局部与屏幕\">坐标空间：世界、局部与屏幕</h2><p>同一个「向右移动」，在不同坐标空间里含义不同，gizmo 必须让用户能选。世界空间（global）下三根轴永远对齐世界坐标轴，无论物体怎么转；局部空间（local）下三根轴跟着物体自身朝向旋转，适合给一个歪着放的物体沿它「自己的前方」移动。专业编辑器还提供父空间、视图空间、甚至自定义工作平面。理解这点要回到变换的数学——一个物体的世界变换是它的局部变换乘以父节点的世界变换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>world</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>parent</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{world}} = M_{\\text{parent}} \\cdot M_{\\text{local}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">world</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在局部空间操纵时，gizmo 的轴方向取自 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>world</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{world}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">world</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的旋转部分；在世界空间操纵时，轴方向就是世界基向量。旋转尤其要小心：内部务必用四元数表示和累加旋转，避免欧拉角的万向锁与累积误差，只在需要给用户显示数值时才转成欧拉角。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[鼠标点击屏幕像素] --&gt; B[构造拾取射线&lt;br/&gt;反投影到世界空间]&#10;    B --&gt; C[射线与场景包围体求交]&#10;    C --&gt; D[选中最近命中物体]&#10;    D --&gt; E[显示 gizmo&lt;br/&gt;按当前坐标空间定轴向]&#10;    E --&gt; F[拖拽: 拾取抓住的轴]&#10;    F --&gt; G[鼠标位移映射到该轴变换]&#10;    G --&gt; H[生成变换命令&lt;br/&gt;提交命令栈]&#10;    H --&gt; I[更新文档模型 视图刷新]\">flowchart TD\n    A[鼠标点击屏幕像素] --&gt; B[构造拾取射线&lt;br/&gt;反投影到世界空间]\n    B --&gt; C[射线与场景包围体求交]\n    C --&gt; D[选中最近命中物体]\n    D --&gt; E[显示 gizmo&lt;br/&gt;按当前坐标空间定轴向]\n    E --&gt; F[拖拽: 拾取抓住的轴]\n    F --&gt; G[鼠标位移映射到该轴变换]\n    G --&gt; H[生成变换命令&lt;br/&gt;提交命令栈]\n    H --&gt; I[更新文档模型 视图刷新]</pre><h2 id=\"编辑辅助-吸附-多选与对齐\">编辑辅助：吸附、多选与对齐</h2><p>裸的拖拽手感再准也不够，真实关卡编辑离不开一堆辅助。网格吸附让位移按固定步长跳变，方便对齐；顶点/表面吸附让物体精确贴到另一物体的几何上；角度吸附让旋转按 15° 之类的整数跳。多选要支持框选（在屏幕上拉一个矩形，选中投影落在矩形内的所有物体）和加选减选，并对多个物体一起做变换——这时 gizmo 通常显示在选区的公共中心，变换施加到每个成员。</p>\n<p>这里有一条贯穿本章的红线：gizmo 拖拽产生的每一次变换，都不能直接写物体的字段，而要包装成一个变换命令，提交到统一的命令栈——这样它才能被撤销重做（见 <a href=\"undo-redo-command\">撤销重做与命令模式</a>）。同时，命令修改的是文档模型，模型变化再通过事件通知所有视图刷新（见 <a href=\"../foundations/editor-architecture\">编辑器架构与数据驱动</a>），保证视口、属性面板、大纲树永远一致。把 gizmo 交互、命令栈、文档模型这三者接对，场景编辑才既好用又可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>屏幕点击选中物体的本质是反投影 + 射线求交：把二维坐标经投影/视图矩阵的逆变换还原成世界空间射线，与场景包围体求交取最近命中。</li>\n<li>gizmo 自身也靠射线拾取判断抓住了哪根轴；拖拽的核心是把鼠标二维位移经「拖拽平面求交 + 投影到轴」翻译成三维变换。</li>\n<li>世界/局部/父等坐标空间决定 gizmo 的轴向，由变换矩阵的层级关系决定；旋转内部务必用四元数避免万向锁，仅显示时转欧拉角。</li>\n<li>实用编辑离不开网格/顶点/角度吸附、框选多选与多物体公共中心变换等辅助功能。</li>\n<li>红线：每次 gizmo 变换都要包装成命令提交命令栈（以支持撤销）、修改文档模型并经事件刷新视图——gizmo、命令栈、文档模型三者接对，场景编辑才可靠。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"场景编辑与 gizmo","id":"场景编辑与-gizmo"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从屏幕点击到三维选中","id":"核心概念-从屏幕点击到三维选中"},{"level":2,"text":"gizmo 的交互机制","id":"gizmo-的交互机制"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标空间：世界、局部与屏幕","id":"坐标空间-世界-局部与屏幕"},{"level":2,"text":"编辑辅助：吸附、多选与对齐","id":"编辑辅助-吸附-多选与对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资源数据库与引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tools-editor-development/asset-pipeline/asset-database-references"},"next":{"title":"撤销重做与命令模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tools-editor-development/editor-features/undo-redo-command"}}